#: scenario6:scenario6_C0D8ECB4_C3F3_4F7B_A234_A58E84B88C67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c68127abeb7fe05b4335ce8fb5680f445a6c5358048136a32df72deb39efca9
#. default-sha256: d68fdf5271f88b6ce68d59c6652452712b85c6783444c0f7c315666d2d9dcc50
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0D8ECB4_C3F3_4F7B_A234_A58E84B88C67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫Several hundred years after I was enslaved within the mansion,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫제가 저택에 갇힌 지 ⟪k:37⟫수백 년이 경과한 시점에서――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2035f314565ed8c4644f11221554b3277ea961e1b596b48049f3c4c81c066c6d
#. default-sha256: 4131cf3fbc0289b9c3bcb4b82b0b2c9dfe543c424653878bab137ab093b66875
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫something changed for the very first time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫처음으로 ⟪k:1⟫저택에 변화가 생겼어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec5fbbe1433a240b07ed29c467bd26fb13726964c91f2237c23bde4ac8385171
#. default-sha256: c617cb3e148a434a2916e8d90665979151698c666ad0a6208f5a2ffd727f1765
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sunlight, which I had not seen in all that time, shone in from outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네……, ⟪k:1⟫제 눈에 ⟪k:2⟫그리운 햇살이 들어온 거죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc380b47943e808b2297361697a1b67e9342f0a2b14134c8f27828f9d8f5c08b
#. default-sha256: 7e0779b939d6dd1f39c72f7d4823395b3d9acedf10dc3bbf6be9372b4885a2cd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first, I did not believe it was real. ⟪k:1⟫I thought it was a hallucination born of my "
"inner desires."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫처음에는 ⟪k:1⟫그게 현실일 줄은 몰랐어요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫제 상상이 지어낸 광경인 줄 알았죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9acc37c535009d0eec758f950f108b52361a815bb4146b27d8559acc46c66424
#. default-sha256: 9ca6edf1a0aeb1531176fc3cc8b1611ef118ecffefb88fc324fc2bd6b2298fbc
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I thought I must have completely lost it for my fantasies to have escaped my mind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫망상의 세계가 시야에 들어올 만큼 ⟪k:2⟫내가 미쳤구나…… 그런 생각을 했어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_E0EFF0B0_F4EC_4C86_8C4E_09D63CF82B05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0324feb6f3dba9c3d12693ccb80df096e10955a17bc08918ffbedfbedbe9139
#. default-sha256: ce692c9a8b73209a374567b510f42380da79f3a6a3921eb1b5b170140e8943b6
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_E0EFF0B0_F4EC_4C86_8C4E_09D63CF82B05"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The time has come, Giselle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s time for you to get to work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫자, ⟪k:2⟫지젤. ⟪k:3⟫당신이 일할 시간이 왔어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_34F6CBFA_78F3_45B3_8F31_59CFF12DE53C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7613d97c90f33cd9d073c0bb6ded1b2efeaa43d3e7e62be75c8251c18a32d754
#. default-sha256: e13fe7dce05f02b53192752955732c3d725187641116bb803a884023f3211dc0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_34F6CBFA_78F3_45B3_8F31_59CFF12DE53C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Reveling in the sight of the outside was the last thing I should have been doing,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……저는 그 광경에 감동이나 할 때가 아니었어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이때, ⟪k:3⟫이 순간이 바로――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_80F86752_F15F_4301_8AE2_C505E3FD8C04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 768e48ad1cc7dd3de5becff2177cf58dcc0159fd1770cb04a0bd9457eb8136ff
#. default-sha256: 101df2970d033575ed33e2632fa91290384472936085149739424a65967b5f0c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_80F86752_F15F_4301_8AE2_C505E3FD8C04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Work? What kind of work?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……일이 ⟪k:1⟫무슨 뜻이죠……?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D477F6A9_07C6_4A3B_B245_F7D67FF2FA52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cfe8bb3b49cdae83311745dc2a964b5d32c17267431d3762ceae2041424100c
#. default-sha256: ccf056e1dce95645b41166e01ed2708c3ff6f0de6c6f8ef9b7242c4e57f91105
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D477F6A9_07C6_4A3B_B245_F7D67FF2FA52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I said, I need you to watch over the house,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and show your utmost hospitality to "
"those who show up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제가 ⟪k:1⟫말했죠. ⟪k:2⟫당신은 이 저택을 지켜봐야 한다고요. ⟪k:3⟫……누군가가 오면 ⟪k:4⟫대접하라"
"고요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0836612C_FBFD_4359_8344_81C40AE9F202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1efc7e1efaf71b5f6498680a82b050579e85ea32778bd52580154fffcb70e77b
#. default-sha256: 1a476b0e5f68ad9d3abe96a06b5c037a950999a73e2141f79422be32593629f4
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0836612C_FBFD_4359_8344_81C40AE9F202"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is someone..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……누군가가……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_A469E825_CE1A_4518_B691_B78A80D10F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50ae03d62fd64f8848908bba6cb72230f43fa001bd7a13cdc85da220d7ed13e6
#. default-sha256: 6e5363122ba799983822695a89158f3758bb9fd10402355326414c860863769d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A469E825_CE1A_4518_B691_B78A80D10F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫H-⟪k:1⟫Hold on!⟪k:2⟫I-⟪k:3⟫I have no idea what I’m supposed to do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫――자, ⟪k:1⟫잠깐만요! ⟪k:2⟫제가 ⟪k:3⟫뭐, ⟪k:4⟫뭘 해야 되죠……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0acdfc390167bcab35b4fb33b6376321fb14c27ef0bcd26f2604161868fdb15e
#. default-sha256: 9646e6c283e2c3c21da3bc9222cd1aa8d6f34361139dc421af584ab07c2b7c35
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do the same thing you have been doing—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫be a maid.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Convince the house’s "
"guests that this is a wonderful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫여태 하던 것처럼 ⟪k:1⟫고용인 노릇을 하시면 돼요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫당신 손으로 이 저택이 아주 좋은 곳"
"이며, ⟪k:4⟫살기 편한 곳이라――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3732a4898af92ae0a9884df511dbfa2a8c6f09d16f022eae00fad8050ae84118
#. default-sha256: 22c99b325917cdf9d98d506170227bc991c0ecebcf240e58b46ab1761e8e9de0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Make them enjoy their stay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫여기게 ⟪k:1⟫만드는 거죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_70266F3D_E042_48CB_AB84_325DB04F15EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e146eb9fc8c52cc7fc9898c5f84c4ba143d14d8a5dd786a062ef2aae6b3f6c5
#. default-sha256: 8c29ee4743cc4ddcd9046e1d82d1a332b32ad9bb2e15488a015e5caae1bc7262
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_70266F3D_E042_48CB_AB84_325DB04F15EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(But will the door... ⟪k:1⟫open?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(문이―― ⟪k:1⟫열리는 건가……?)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6eef8d228153969d5950b09c8ce8b8f85c2e4bf12ed8b49e24def7f4f9978034
#. default-sha256: fa7e47e5c362da19f09d9e8b4f9fbce5e5b2821b9af8e7564217dbd336b3f5b4
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For so long, the door had refused to budge.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For so long, light had forsaken "
"these halls.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫For so long, there had been no trace of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫결코 열리지 않던 문. ⟪k:2⟫결코 빛이 들지 않던 창문. ⟪k:3⟫생물의 기척이 어디에도 없던 저"
"택."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b98b89fc563b762d462d3b7d0dc482b96118d9b4c93ce11c0aa8849de909d6a7
#. default-sha256: dab2bd3ce92c0d7a1bfa32c81b667458c02fc3f132e0f69cf517cdc7fcb3e725
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And now, all of that had been turned on its head."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모든 것이 ⟪k:1⟫뒤바뀌었어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_48D2F6F0_DB1E_47E7_BCE8_38526208AA81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 362a955d96ef2499082f1bf98a06e0e534a1b51cb6e79dc530b8b002359168d5
#. default-sha256: 812d479fd5a29575b8ccf209af455da1585f44280b71a67a7d0b3692d7a96ebf
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_48D2F6F0_DB1E_47E7_BCE8_38526208AA81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was almost certainly a perfectly ordinary slice of nature.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Leaves and grass "
"rustled in the wind, flowers specked the earth,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫크게 특이할 것 없는 ⟪k:1⟫교외 광경이었을 거예요. ⟪k:2⟫초목이 흔들리며, ⟪k:3⟫작은 꽃이 띄엄띄"
"엄 피어 있었고……"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D13D5DE9_195F_4D3C_81C4_5F28348226CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26bbd9b2bee08dfb6ec703526a27aef9c549bccb0855e9816fb34090a000fd22
#. default-sha256: a4cc07aa96ccfab54286b5b8df3c5ce4165b891ed062880cb3fbd07a233d2e5f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D13D5DE9_195F_4D3C_81C4_5F28348226CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and in the distance was a city I didn’t recognize."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저 멀리에 ⟪k:1⟫난생 처음 보는 도시가 보였어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_74392373_5663_4CF6_84BF_B3306B93FFFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_74392373_5663_4CF6_84BF_B3306B93FFFC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9AABB09C_CF88_4A18_A3CA_56C00600AA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d409f4f965c01a98d645ae4940816097df87a45e6925d05556e66f1c37b49e1
#. default-sha256: af35f1fddab8f67e661d128e88a3b2e00dfb2a48ca6c617cc2e8490f90db790f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9AABB09C_CF88_4A18_A3CA_56C00600AA69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I was standing there idly before the entrance, a carriage rolled up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그렇게 ⟪k:2⟫저택 입구에서 우두커니 서 있다 보니, ⟪k:3⟫마차 한 대가 이리로 왔어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F3B45874_CAF6_4E5B_AE11_85DD6996100F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf99ece088e1e58e619fd99158893a3e3e00dae2d9739cf78043ecfad8609865
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F3B45874_CAF6_4E5B_AE11_85DD6996100F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9724AECD_04EF_42BA_A8BE_8767E042080F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 248850002e07d3f1fb762f2c0fcb745a11148db27f2f1921804a088bf4c89772
#. default-sha256: 41bb142f3ef391ab77557fad2d83bb2967e53f8607b3f0970039c86118593313
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9724AECD_04EF_42BA_A8BE_8767E042080F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mm? And who might you be, young lady?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That outfit..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫응? ⟪k:1⟫자네는…… 누군가? ⟪k:2⟫게다가 ⟪k:3⟫그 차림새……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_2BA96708_D781_43B5_984B_CAB87143E16E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71d51a38974d27a44eea62871ef519a8bb653a22e43e5507740008bb9a2b3b84
#. default-sha256: 5600fc62744c9dd1a9abcb7f60c2c696044f5d3963b478f6bcba1c41dd28f92c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2BA96708_D781_43B5_984B_CAB87143E16E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Could the mansion... ⟪k:1⟫have moved somewhere far, far away...?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(이 저택은 ⟪k:1⟫설마 ⟪k:2⟫몹시 머나먼 곳까지……)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_3368DB51_6FE4_4865_9B98_E0C8669209D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a97a0c7f109d65feef4f53c660fe14dd9b06abf0b2d06f24cc0d7c251dcde00c
#. default-sha256: 377237fab0a4ee248b82645ad3db43f9e79274da3459f7c3f1b541df8c3ff771
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_3368DB51_6FE4_4865_9B98_E0C8669209D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Naturally, I had no idea how such a thing was possible."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 일이 어떻게 일어나는 건진 ⟪k:1⟫이해조차 불가능했어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D43BC81C_DC3C_4882_B12A_C944953139E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df1473f03b31cea184c10939edf5df456aaaf8ccc44ef9a28197d941c2b51c06
#. default-sha256: c908d9b9355776def2884d478264df581f007e53826e2a8f506c84603a858900
