msgid "⟪k:0⟫The whole house looked as though it was cackling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건―― 웃는 것처럼도 보였어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DC3E388B_E1C4_470B_84FE_117A01E7ACE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
