"how she felt now that her centuries-in-the-making wish was bearing fruit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……그게 바로 ⟪k:1⟫마녀 모르가나의 광기였겠죠.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫모르가나의 묵은 희열이 ⟪k:4⟫형상화된 것"
"이었겠죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_3B1FCC3D_EEB0_4E9D_9E30_AC9980B0443A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
