msgid "⟪k:0⟫Those two children were the ones Morgana had been waiting for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저 둘이 ⟪k:1⟫모르가나가 기다리던 자들……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0B46AED7_D9D1_425D_B83E_839305C96B69
