msgid "⟪k:0⟫I would have done something before the house swallowed them up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫최소한 둘만이라도 구하려고 ⟪k:1⟫저택에 삼켜지기 전에 행동했을 거예요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9B7FAE1D_82A8_4CC6_B1A0_E8F708FC27A2
