msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I let Hayden’s beloved grandchildren fall into the witch’s hands."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫헤이든이 깊이 아끼던 손주들을 ⟪k:2⟫저버렸어요."

#: scenario6:scenario6_78659509_883F_4472_9908_B1BAC557EAB0
