msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because you’re my ally. My trusty servant.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You and I, we live in the same world."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We’re as close as family—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신은 제 편……, ⟪k:1⟫제 하수인, ⟪k:2⟫저와 같은 세계에 사는 자.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫피를 나눈 가족이나 다"
"름없으니까요――"

