"⟪k:0⟫Let us inflict a pain worse than physical torture on them.⟪k:1⟫Let us put their souls on the "
"rack for all eternity!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫육체적 고통보다 ⟪k:1⟫훨씬 아픈―― 혼의 고통을 주죠!"

