msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저주해요…… ⟪k:1⟫고통을 주죠…… ⟪k:2⟫저주해요……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7E0DF081_8B43_4B66_8FFC_11D86CD16D77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53ab134059cf84719a462ee54f8c5abe3da7371d7923e44d51d21ce44781634a
