"⟪k:0⟫Now, listen carefully, Giselle.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This is a tale of wicked men, and my curse upon "
"them..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자―― 지젤, ⟪k:1⟫잘 들으세요…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 남자들의 ⟪k:4⟫끔찍한 악행을―― 제 저주의 말을……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_EF140E09_87B4_48D7_B876_7386F4889D10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72e5e124e8f27486ed8392f8524ed5e960156f0f2e93a2a7ac2fbc95bf04e566
