msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_EF140E09_87B4_48D7_B876_7386F4889D10"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was brutally honest, each word a carefully sharpened blade of animosity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마녀의 말은 ⟪k:1⟫어떤 의미로는 ⟪k:2⟫순수했어요. ⟪k:3⟫그 악의는 일편단심으로 연마되어 있었죠."

#: scenario6:scenario6_9E28183E_CC71_4774_A8FC_CABE9DC09E50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
