msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D60E783C_FA52_4904_8EEB_BE7A8507CCA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How long did you have to feel nothing but hatred to become like her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫얼마나 오래 ⟪k:1⟫증오만을 품으면⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마녀처럼 되는 걸까요……."

#: scenario6:scenario6_C29CB184_AECE_4DC2_9E24_9EF71AF1C644
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c37428b318dfd36f460a7df66915b2bf0f0cba35cd66634c12ccf2b18267c35d
