msgid "⟪k:0⟫I felt like, if I let my guard down, I would be consumed by her enmity—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자칫하면 ⟪k:1⟫저까지 ⟪k:2⟫그 악의에 홀려――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_B2BFCBE5_CBF6_41E7_98B0_11DE2BC310D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
